@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Use - LinkedLearn";
}

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</p>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate lg:prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                <p>By accessing and using LinkedLearn, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Use. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or use the platform.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. User Roles and Conduct</h2>
                <p>The platform supports multiple roles including Guests, Users (Learners), Instructors, and Administrators. You agree to use the platform in a manner consistent with your role.</p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-2">
                    <li><strong>Learners:</strong> Must not share account access or illegally distribute purchased course materials.</li>
                    <li><strong>Instructors:</strong> Are responsible for the accuracy, legality, and quality of the content they publish.</li>
                    <li><strong>All Users:</strong> Must refrain from posting offensive, spam, or inappropriate content in reviews or chat messages. Such content will be flagged by our AI moderation and human reviewers.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Account Security</h2>
                <p>You are responsible for safeguarding the password that you use to access the platform and for any activities or actions under your password. You agree not to disclose your password to any third party. You must notify us immediately upon becoming aware of any breach of security or unauthorized use of your account.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">4. Content Ownership and Copyright</h2>
                <p>Instructors retain ownership of the course content they upload. However, by publishing courses on LinkedLearn, instructors grant the platform a license to host, display, and distribute the content to enrolled learners. Users reporting copyright violations should use the "Report A Course" feature.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">5. Termination</h2>
                <p>We may terminate or suspend access to our platform immediately, without prior notice or liability, for any reason whatsoever, including without limitation if you breach the Terms of Use. Multiple flagged violations may lead to automatic account locking.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
